  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You begin to take on characteristics of your patron's kind. You have Resistance to a damage type determined by your patron's kind: Bludgeoning (dao), Thunder (djinni), Fire (efreeti), or Cold (marid).</p><p>In addition, as a Bonus Action, you can give yourself a Fly Speed of 30 feet that lasts for 10 minutes, during which you can hover. You can use this Bonus Action a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-tAiL3jJ22QKD85kA\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Turn on the Resistance effect of your patron's kind only.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
